
## Setup: build the bareproxy.com site with Hugo, precompress, add bait
60 files, 34 gzip copies, plus .git/config, etc-link -> /etc, etc-rel -> ../../../../etc

## The config (line numbers added for reading)
     1	# BareProxy live test: the bareproxy.com Hugo site plus a test API
     2	global
     3	  admin run/admin.sock
     4	  state run/state
     5	  trace-log run/requests.log
     6	
     7	site bareproxy.com:8443 http://bareproxy.com:8080
     8	  tls certs/cert.pem certs/key.pem
     9	  error 404 /404.html
    10	  route /api/* -> api strip
    11	  route /* -> files public
    12	
    13	pool api
    14	  backend 127.0.0.1:9081
    15	  backend 127.0.0.1:9082
    16	  backend 127.0.0.1:9083
    17	  health /healthz every 1s

$ ../bin/bareproxy check live.conf
live.conf: ok, 1 site, 1 pool, 2 rules; listening on :8080 (http), :8443 (https)

