## Precompressed copies, conditional requests, byte ranges, HEAD

$ curl -H Accept-Encoding: gzip https://bareproxy.com:8443/platform/
HTTP/2 200 
  bareproxy-id: 2ca3efce18d42fc5
  content-encoding: gzip
  content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
  etag: "18dba6ae61b62a42-e0d-gz"
  vary: Accept-Encoding

$ curl -H If-None-Match: "18dba6ae61b62a42-54fe" https://bareproxy.com:8443/platform/
HTTP/2 304 
  bareproxy-id: f6a8d4720a123068
  etag: "18dba6ae61b62a42-54fe"
  vary: Accept-Encoding

$ curl -r 0-99 https://bareproxy.com:8443/images/plan-demo.png
HTTP/2 206 
  bareproxy-id: 1adf2908af52f076
