bareproxy: 2026/10/05 16:55:51 pool api: 127.0.0.1:9082 down after 3 failed checks (connect refused)
bareproxy: 2026/10/05 16:55:53 reload: live.conf can't go live (the config has errors, so nothing changed; line 10: error: no pool named apix), so version 1 keeps running

